  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Demobilization and Transitional Reintegration Project in Burundi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE OVERALL PROJECT OBJECTIVE IS TO SUPPORT THE EFFORTS OF THE GOB demobilize combatants of Agathon Rwasa#s FNL and the FNL-D, and  provide social and economic reintegration support to these  beneficiaries, as well as to a small remaining caseload from the  recently closed EDRRP project.  This will include a special emphasis  on support for women, children and the disabled. The project would  thereby contribute to consolidation of peace and stability in Burundi  and improve security in the Great Lakes region.</narrative>
  </description>
